{
  "name": "48 · Meeting Notes (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 48 · Meeting Notes\nPaste a meeting transcript in a form → AI writes clean notes (summary, decisions, action items with owner + due date) into a **Google Doc**, adds every action to your **Actions** sheet, and drafts a follow-up email to the attendees.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Docs nodes: add a **Google Docs OAuth2** credential.\n2. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Actions**: Meeting, Date, Task, Owner, Due, Status, Notes.\n3. Gmail nodes: add a **Gmail OAuth2** credential.\n4. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nGet transcripts from Google Meet (Gemini notes), Zoom, or any voice-to-text app. Always tell people when a meeting is recorded.",
        "height": 595,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "f4432d3c-2816-4154-961f-a0df0e6601ee",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Meeting → notes + action items",
        "formDescription": "Paste the transcript (Google Meet / Zoom / WhatsApp voice-note text). Notes go to a Google Doc, actions to your sheet, and a follow-up email draft is created.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Meeting title",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Attendee emails (comma separated)"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Transcript",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "72175018-b613-4385-94d6-61cb24b56c69",
      "name": "Paste transcript",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Meeting: {{ $json['Meeting title'] }} on {{ $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('d LLL yyyy') }}.\nTranscript:\n{{ String($json.Transcript).slice(0, 20000) }}\n\nReturn: summary (4-6 lines), decisions (list), actions (list of {task, owner, due}: due as yyyy-mm-dd only if a date was said, else 'not set'), open_questions (list), follow_up_email (a short polite email to attendees recapping decisions and actions). Only what was actually said; never invent owners or dates.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "30ee0a2f-3351-4749-b6b4-e2ab2248b157",
      "name": "AI writes notes",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "1db30f04-0f00-4816-9777-f70b9787e5d9",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        180,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"summary\": \"...\",\n  \"decisions\": [\n    \"...\"\n  ],\n  \"actions\": [\n    {\n      \"task\": \"Send revised quote\",\n      \"owner\": \"Arjun\",\n      \"due\": \"2026-10-31\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"open_questions\": [\n    \"...\"\n  ],\n  \"follow_up_email\": \"Hi all, ...\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "5876a8f3-6cc3-406a-bc63-405578ba4654",
      "name": "JSON shape",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        380,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const o = $json.output, f = $('Paste transcript').item.json;\nconst L = a => (a || []).map(x => '• ' + x).join('\\n') || '• none';\nreturn { json: { title: `Notes – ${f['Meeting title']} – ${$now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('d LLL yyyy')}`,\n  body: `SUMMARY\\n${o.summary}\\n\\nDECISIONS\\n${L(o.decisions)}\\n\\nACTION ITEMS\\n${L((o.actions || []).map(a => `${a.task} – ${a.owner} – due ${a.due}`))}\\n\\nOPEN QUESTIONS\\n${L(o.open_questions)}` } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "1165cd46-6526-4042-aeb7-8c615803012f",
      "name": "Notes text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        620,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "folderId": "default",
        "title": "={{ $json.title }}"
      },
      "id": "e98419fb-37c2-4447-a55a-7e83f4f7f01e",
      "name": "Create Google Doc",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDocs",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        860,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentURL": "={{ $json.id }}",
        "actionsUi": {
          "actionFields": [
            {
              "object": "text",
              "action": "insert",
              "text": "={{ $('Notes text').item.json.body }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "52379ef0-0658-473f-b0f3-f370eb1ad60f",
      "name": "Write notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDocs",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const o = $('AI writes notes').first().json.output, f = $('Paste transcript').first().json;\nreturn (o.actions || []).map(a => ({ json: { Meeting: f['Meeting title'], Date: $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd'), Task: a.task, Owner: a.owner, Due: a.due, Status: 'open',\n  Notes: 'https://docs.google.com/document/d/' + $('Create Google Doc').first().json.id } }));"
      },
      "id": "4dfa18bc-7052-4486-995e-a1391ba69a0d",
      "name": "Action rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
